    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n77844" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραγεύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>give a taste</i> of a thing, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φρονήματος παραγεύειν τὸ θῆλυ</span>
